<title>USA: St Joseph hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower than Friday's trade. Top $ per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>Icy road conditions hampering movement and receipts will fall short of early estimate, totalling only around 300 vs early estimates of 500.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	230-270 lbs    52.50-53.00</p>
<p>Sows: No good price comparison available from late last week.</p>
<p>Top 53.00.few US 1-2	300-450 lbs    43.00</p>
<p>few		 450-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>few US 1-3	500-550 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>few		 550-700 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
